WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.040
Hey everyone Diavolo here and today we are
diving right back into Jujutsu kaisen and

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:08.630
the current beatdown going on between two
of the universes strongest fighters.

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:15.410
Yes this is the Decisive Satoru Gojo Vs Ryomen
Sukuna Battle in the uninhabited, Demon-Infested

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:19.190
district of Shinjuku (or at least everything
so far).

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:25.850
Nothing that I could think of throughout the
series, bar maybe Sukuna Vs Mahoraga, even

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:30.300
comes close to the scale of cursed energy
consumption or destruction that we bear witness

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.360
to here.

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:35.350
This is truly an amazing fight to behold and
encapsulates everything that makes Jujutsu

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:37.140
Kaisen so freaking good!

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:41.190
So if you are new around here make sure to
subscribe to keep upto date with all of Jujutsu

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:45.450
Kaisen, and if you do enjoy the video make
sure to leave a like and try push this to

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:50.070
to 5k likes so I know you all want to see
more.

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:55.260
But either way sit back and relax as we watch
Shinjuku get wiped from reality.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:01:00.219
Well I guess ill take everything back to the
moment we kicked off, and yes of course massive

00:01:00.219 --> 00:01:04.760
manga spoilers for any anime only’s who
happened to stumble across this fight.

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:09.350
Any who, as all of the Sorcerers were lacking
out discussing how to give Gojo a boost of

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:12.380
confidence, as its the first time they’re
really ever needed too.

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:16.701
Gojo himself, accompanied by Gramps and Utahime
all with looks of determination, then roll

00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:18.790
up to get ready for battle.

00:01:18.790 --> 00:01:22.870
With everyone around feeling his aura, Yuji
greets his sensei wholeheartedly and lets

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:26.369
him know that he cant get close cause his
Techniques in the way.

00:01:26.369 --> 00:01:30.729
Gojo is slightly surprised, but after a moment
ends up laughing while telling his boy to

00:01:30.729 --> 00:01:34.630
give it to him, causing Yuji to jump up and
slap his Sensei on the back.

00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:39.000
Then following on the same path, every other
sorcerer patted Gojo on the back as he rolled

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.890
through the group on his way to the battlefield.

00:01:41.890 --> 00:01:46.369
Walking through a skyscraper with Gojo, Ijichi
notes that it feels like ages since he was

00:01:46.369 --> 00:01:51.140
last here, when in all reality its only been
just over a month now.

00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:55.090
Wanting to know what the realm felt like,
Gojo explains to Ijichi that the Prison Realm

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:59.159
was like when ya mad busy with work that it
flashes in a week, however the feelings so

00:01:59.159 --> 00:02:02.369
draining you'd never want to experience it
again.

00:02:02.369 --> 00:02:06.270
A few moments later, Gojo inquires about the
people in the basement of Shibuya’s metro

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:08.530
station where all the chaos started.

00:02:08.530 --> 00:02:16.660
If we’re being specific, that’s where
Gojo came across Choso, Hanami and Jogo.

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:21.160
Even though Gojo fought them for a very short
period of time, it left remnants of Gojo’s

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:24.550
cursed energy that made Cursed Spirits avoid
the floor entirely.

00:02:24.550 --> 00:02:29.050
WHICH IS ACTUALLY INSANE WHEN YOU THINK ABOUT
IT, THIS MAN IS SO STRONG EVEN HIS RESIDUALS

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:33.819
SCARE CURSED SPIRITS.

00:02:33.819 --> 00:02:38.500
Ijichi also reveals that the people who were
affected by his 0.2-second domain are all

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:41.780
fine and those that were effected returned
to normal.

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:46.350
Walking up behind Gramps and Utahime atop
the roof, Gojo and Ijichi arrive as the day

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:48.410
of reckoning has begun.

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:52.909
Elsewhere Uraume asks what time the fights
going to take place, to which Sukuna reveals

00:02:52.909 --> 00:02:57.239
that they didnt specify a time, but as he
says that he’s able to feel Gojo’s aura

00:02:57.239 --> 00:02:59.489
emanating in his direction.

00:02:59.489 --> 00:03:03.769
Back in the hallway just moments before they
made it to the roof, Ijichi confronted Gojo

00:03:03.769 --> 00:03:06.459
on why he wanted him to construct the barrier.

00:03:06.459 --> 00:03:11.019
Turning back and looking at his close friend,
Gojo tells him that its because he trusts

00:03:11.019 --> 00:03:13.180
him more than anyone else.

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:17.630
Now atop the roof and slamming his hands onto
the ground in preparation for his barrier,

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:22.049
Ijichi just thinks on how he’s someone who
always fled, no someone who didnt even have

00:03:22.049 --> 00:03:26.010
the courage to flee and was given the courage
to run by a friend.

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:31.300
Despite everything Ijichi braces himself and
notes that he must live up to Gojo’s expectations,

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:32.879
either that or die trying!

00:03:32.879 --> 00:03:37.750
Infront of the two and while using her cursed
Technique called Solo Forbidden Arena.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:42.739
Its explained that any sorcerer of her choosing,
including Utahime herself, will have their

00:03:42.739 --> 00:03:47.770
cursed energy reserves and output temporarily
enhanced as long as they remain in range.

00:03:47.770 --> 00:03:50.680
To excel at Jujutsu is to excel at subtraction.

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:55.319
The degree to which a sorcerer can omit cadence,
movement and other elements that relate to

00:03:55.319 --> 00:03:59.450
their cursed technique determines their skill,
and Utahime leaves nothing.

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:01.569
Words, Gestures, Dance, Music.

00:04:01.569 --> 00:04:06.689
Elevating the simple technique to that of
a ritual boosts its effectiveness by 120%.

00:04:06.689 --> 00:04:13.000
Utahime’s CT allows her to boost the chosen
sorcerer’s cursed energy and as Gojo himself

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:18.949
also begins chanting to add to his own technique
“Nine Ropes, Polarized light, crow and declaration,

00:04:18.949 --> 00:04:24.460
between front and back, its revealed that
just like our girl, Gojo also never left anything

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:30.570
out and with the combination of the trio’s
cursed energy shoots forth his 200% hollow

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:31.570
purple.

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:35.860
As Gojo’s ability blasts forth, Sukuna manages
to take notice of it and throws up his hands

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:39.880
trying to block the entire attack, with the
buildings all around him exploding due to

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:44.130
hollow purple, Sukuna’s defenses are undoubtedly
breached as the building he was standing on

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:47.510
is completely demolished, causing it to fall
to the ground below.

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:53.169
Uruame who was next to Sukuna at the time
of attack has also not been since this moment,

00:04:53.169 --> 00:05:03.840
correct me if im wrong, but after this 
attack she’s seemingly vanished.

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:04.840
Either way.

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:08.880
As the smoke slowly fades its made evident
that due to Ijichi’s barrier Sukuna actually

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:13.380
misread Gojo’s first move, like even though
he knew where he was he didnt sense the insane

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:16.210
cursed energy output until the last moment.

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:20.490
Bursting through the smoke, SUKUNA with one
less hand someone managed to tank the first

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:25.680
attack leaving the true battle between history
and todays strongest sorcerers to continue.

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:31.740
So back before the blast, Sukuna and Uraume
were located at Shinjuku Center which is around

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:36.280
4-5 kilometers away from the Shibuya building
Gojo was currently on with his team.

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:41.440
Having strolled across that distance in a
matter of moments Gojo sets the record straight

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:44.930
and tells the king of curses that he’s the
challenger here!

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:46.270
The Challenger?

00:05:46.270 --> 00:05:49.910
Sukuna standing there finds it utterly pathetic
that Gojo would state that after landing a

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:51.220
surprise attack.

00:05:51.220 --> 00:05:56.039
In his eyes and as he brings his hands together
Gojo is no more than a fish atop his chopping

00:05:56.039 --> 00:05:59.710
board, one slightly fresher but still just
a nameless fish.

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:04.000
Flaring up his cursed energy, Sukuna just
remarks that its time he start peeling back

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:05.370
Gojo’s scales.

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:08.821
Gojo Asks him why he’s still wearing that
face and guesses that Sukuna’s original

00:06:08.821 --> 00:06:12.600
thought was to steal Megumi’s body so he’d
hold back.

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:15.949
Unfortunately for him, our mans been through
a specific set of training that allows him

00:06:15.949 --> 00:06:21.979
to go all out on anyone who resembles any
sort of resemblance to the great Toji Fushiguro.

00:06:21.979 --> 00:06:26.030
Considering that Gojo himself trained Megumi,
he he probably knows exactly how many hits

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:29.870
his student could take before he’s die,
and Given that Sukuna had survived death while

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:34.500
possessing Yuji, Gojo thought it would be
prudent to only start worrying about Megumi’s

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:37.580
welfare after he kills the person in control.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:42.450
Initiating the conflict, the duo dart at each
other, both just narrowly dodging each successive

00:06:42.450 --> 00:06:43.450
strike.

00:06:43.450 --> 00:06:46.610
Dropping to the floor, just out of range of
Sukuna, Gojo flicks his hand straight into

00:06:46.610 --> 00:06:50.319
his opponents nuts, sending them shooting
through the side of a nearby building and

00:06:50.319 --> 00:06:53.140
out the other, crashing into some stairs behind
it.

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:57.389
Getting up, he’s instantly harassed by Gojo
who stomping in his direction, proceeds to

00:06:57.389 --> 00:07:02.100
kick him in the gut so he’s perfectly placed
into the middle of a overpass bridge platform.

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:05.960
Continuing to stomp down, Gojo collapses the
platform Sukuna was on, making his footing

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:07.830
extremely unstable.

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:11.570
Taking the opportunity to catch him off-guard,
Gojo activates his infinity and levitates

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:16.110
the bridge into the sky, before tossing it
directly at a larger skyscraper.

00:07:16.110 --> 00:07:20.350
Resisting the force of the platform, Sukuna
uses dismantle or what I assume to be dismantle

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:21.780
to cause the structure to collapse.

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:26.610
Making it over to a nearby roof in the flash
of an eye, Sukuna pulls up his hand and sends

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:30.569
a massive slice using dismantle to cut the
building directly behind Gojo in half.

00:07:30.569 --> 00:07:34.910
With our man turning around to look at it,
Sukuna quickly rushes him throwing a fat right

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:39.360
hook that catches Gojo off-guard, however
as the punch connects with his infinity he

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:44.820
decides his technique in on order to physically
take Sukuna inside of the collapsing structure.

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:48.529
Following him up a hallway, Gojo quickly opens
a door that for a moment blinds the two fights

00:07:48.529 --> 00:07:51.710
from seeing exactly what ability they’re
about to throw at each-other.

00:07:51.710 --> 00:07:55.580
Catching them both off-guard though, the building
crashes into the ground bringing the previously

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:57.850
intense fight to a brief pause.

00:07:57.850 --> 00:08:01.759
Walking out of the debris while all of the
smoke slowly starts to disperse, Gojo jokes

00:08:01.759 --> 00:08:06.789
that well, he’s gonna pin all this destruction
on him once he gets outa here.

00:08:06.789 --> 00:08:10.909
Sukuna points out that he really cant say
anything, quickly making Gojo realize that

00:08:10.909 --> 00:08:15.349
Mei’s actually streaming this entire fight.

00:08:15.349 --> 00:08:39.279
So 

00:08:39.279 --> 00:08:54.680
when it comes 

00:08:54.680 --> 00:09:09.660
to 

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:13.860
down to Gojo’s limitless technique, it allows
him to be completely untouchable.

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:17.960
To get around this and in a similar way to
what Hanami and Jogo did, Sukuna is using

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:21.580
domain amplification to neutralize his cursed
technique.

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:26.270
Confused slightly on what Domain amplification
is, Yuta explains to everyone while they watch

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:28.850
the fight that he saw something similar in
Mechamaru’s footage.

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:34.770
He pretty much said what I said before about
Jogo and Hanami.

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:40.730
Hakari points out that it does seem like Gojo’s
domain has been neutralized, but he’s still

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:42.060
confused how.

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:46.500
The old G Kusakabe lets them all know though
that its more of a refined version of a simple

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:47.500
domain.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:51.540
If one sheaths themselves in a domain without
imbuing your own cursed technique, you allow

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:56.240
the opponents technique to flow into that
empty space, thereby neutralizing it.

00:09:56.240 --> 00:10:01.040
Angel points out that the main draw back to
domain amplifications are that you can simultaneously

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:05.790
use your own innate technique, no one not
even Sukuna is an exception to this rule.

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:10.390
So in here eyes, if Sukuna has another way
to deal with limitless other than Domain Amp,

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:13.430
then Gojo will lose.

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:17.490
Confused on why they don't just use a domain
expansion, Miwa enquires as to why.

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:22.339
She knows that immediately following the Domain,
ones technique becomes unstable so it would

00:10:22.339 --> 00:10:25.940
make sense for Sukuna to challenge a domain
battle first.

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:30.330
Kirara notes that is easy to say that, but
depending on the outcome of that domain battle,

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:35.209
the fight would be over, which in both of
there eyes is the correct battle strategy.

00:10:35.209 --> 00:10:39.100
Yuji though having been told something by
Gojo reveals that he’s pretty sure the domains

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:42.280
sure hit effect negates Gojo’s technique
to begin with.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:47.220
Perking up, Ui Ui wonders if its because Sukuna
doesn't think he can win in a domain struggle

00:10:47.220 --> 00:10:48.490
against Gojo.

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:52.899
Still Shoko points out that well yeah your
right but he probably would have opened one

00:10:52.899 --> 00:10:58.070
if that was the case, so she finds it hard
to believe that Gojo wouldn't be able to foresee

00:10:58.070 --> 00:10:59.070
that.

00:10:59.070 --> 00:11:02.959
Standing there, Choso ponders the question
of what would happen if Gojo’s domain did

00:11:02.959 --> 00:11:07.000
clash, as from what he was told Sukuna’s
domain is barrier-less.

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:10.720
Hearing this bizarre statement, everyone just
reacts in shock, unable to believe that his

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:12.440
domain doesn't have a barrier.

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:18.970
As an example of how its just impossible,
Kusakabe asks Miwa to toss him that water.

00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:22.529
However after she gives him the bottle he
throws it back, telling her to give him the

00:11:22.529 --> 00:11:25.180
water not the bottle.

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:29.490
Confused, Miwa facials the absolute hell out
of Kusakabe, while in behind them Mei San

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:34.130
explains that expanding a domain without a
barrier is just like trying hold water without

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:35.330
a bottle.

00:11:35.330 --> 00:11:38.079
With no container, can you even accumulate
water?

00:11:38.079 --> 00:11:40.380
Can you paint on thin air without a canvas?

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:44.209
with no stem, roots or leaves can a flower
bloom from a seed?

00:11:44.209 --> 00:11:48.389
Maki compares it to like using software without
even having a pc to run anything on.

00:11:48.389 --> 00:11:52.720
Its frankly unfathomable in their eyes, completely
impossible.

00:11:52.720 --> 00:11:56.950
Even still she notes that Megumi’s Domain
was never enclosed within a barrier, and having

00:11:56.950 --> 00:12:01.360
heard of that before Megumi was given his
grade promotion, Kusakabe explained that to

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:05.840
use it he had to use an existing structure
to enclose his domain.

00:12:05.840 --> 00:12:12.230
Noritoshi Kamo or just good ole Kenjaku though
was able to pull it off so it does prove that

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:13.400
it can happen.

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:17.170
Choso who actually fought during that battle
pointed out that they’d prepared to use

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:21.980
a simple domain on Kenjaku while Tengen dismantled
his domain from the outside, however because

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:26.029
of the barrierless domain it was the simple
domain that was torn apart.

00:12:26.029 --> 00:12:31.480
Miwa who’s confused over what exactly would
clash, states that the sure hit effect is

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:35.470
imbued within the barrier itself, so it can
only clash with another barrier.

00:12:35.470 --> 00:12:40.769
She also realizes that well everyone's talking
as if there domains are a given, but domains

00:12:40.769 --> 00:12:45.730
devour an insane amount of cursed energy,
so wouldn't avoiding using them make sense?

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:50.779
Inumaki speaks up and notes that well it doesn't
really matter since Gojo has infinite cursed

00:12:50.779 --> 00:12:51.779
energy.

00:12:51.779 --> 00:12:58.070
Ino knows its just due to how skilled he is
at using his technique, if his cursed energy

00:12:58.070 --> 00:13:02.899
consumption rate ends up being less that what
he replenishes, then it could run out.

00:13:02.899 --> 00:13:07.139
Thats just working under the assumption he’s
using it like normal though, if he changes

00:13:07.139 --> 00:13:12.290
things up and states using domains consecutively,
then it could also be another story.

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:18.440
Not having even mentioned what Sukuna is capable
of, Kashimo speaks up to state that the sharpness

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:20.680
of his techniques activation is unparalled.

00:13:20.680 --> 00:13:24.820
The way he can switch things up in a matter
of milliseconds, from innate technique to

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:27.529
domain amplification is amazing.

00:13:27.529 --> 00:13:31.400
If Gojo literally wasn't who he isn't, then
Sukuna would comfortably be winning in terms

00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:33.730
of cursed energy utility.

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:37.971
What's more, his total cursed energy is probably
even more than Yuta’s, from what he can

00:13:37.971 --> 00:13:42.100
physically tell he’d say its probably double.

00:13:42.100 --> 00:13:46.690
Momo who’s been pretty quiet this entire
chat, pops up as she feels that maybe nobody,

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:48.930
not even them knows how this is going to play
out.

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:54.520
If Gojo and Sukuna’s Domains do clash who
knows what's gonna happen, then right on that

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:58.600
exact moment and after all of the build up
we just went through.

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:02.660
Higuruma signals that they are about to begin,
the Domain Clashes.

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:07.320
Back in Shinjuku, both Sukuna and Gojo throw
up their respective hand signals to simultaneously

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:10.160
open, the infinite void and malevolent shrine.

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:14.800
With Sukuna now appearing above his shrine
and Gojo standing a few feet back, its explained

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:16.639
that the two are evenly matched.

00:14:16.639 --> 00:14:21.449
They form a perfect pair within Gojo’s barrier,
which in turn meant that both guaranteed hits

00:14:21.449 --> 00:14:24.180
overlapped each other then canceled themselves
out.

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:28.690
In this battle with as the two expand their
domains, should either one of them sustain

00:14:28.690 --> 00:14:33.199
severe damage, it will cause the collapse
of their domain and the other ones sure hit

00:14:33.199 --> 00:14:35.180
will immediately take effect.

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:40.029
Back at the TV room, Kusakabe and Mei Mei
both react in shock as somehow even with the

00:14:40.029 --> 00:14:42.390
domains active they’re still evenly matched.

00:14:42.390 --> 00:14:46.690
In Shinjuku the pure force of the two overlapping
domains causes the surrounding area to start

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:47.690
getting atomized.

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:53.160
Sadly for Gojo, the effective range of Sukuna’s
domain reaches even beyond that of a barrier,

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:57.550
and just as Yuji notes that a domain expansion
is weak from the outside, Gojo’s domain

00:14:57.550 --> 00:15:03.120
cracks and shatters as its shown that below
it Sukuna’s domain now sits perfectly fine.

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:06.850
With no protection against Sukuna’s Sure
hit technique, the effect immediately fly's

00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:10.779
forth and seemingly cuts down the strongest
sorcerer of today!

00:15:10.779 --> 00:15:16.079
Having taken the slash to his neck, Gojo nonchalantly
activates his RCT, which everyone back at

00:15:16.079 --> 00:15:17.610
the lair reacts to.

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:22.560
Higuruma states that as long as Gojo stays
in range, the slashes will never stop coming.

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:27.259
Choso who assumes escaping is probably the
port of call for Gojo, is backed by Hakari

00:15:27.259 --> 00:15:28.800
who somewhat agree with him.

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:33.360
However its more that Hakari assumes Gojo
will make a dash for the exit, whereas Kusakabe

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:37.850
realizes that teleporting is out of the question
since its an application of the limitless

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:38.850
technique.

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:42.550
Due to the use of his domain expansion and
it being destroyed its plausible that for

00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:44.970
a moment he cant use his cursed technique.

00:15:44.970 --> 00:15:48.930
Which like they state, means he’s in store
for one hell of a beatdown.

00:15:48.930 --> 00:15:53.530
Back inside of Sukuna’s Domain Expansion,
Gojo is relentlessly slashed over and over

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:56.410
again by the sure hit effect of the Domain.

00:15:56.410 --> 00:16:00.320
Somehow though Gojo manages to calm himself
as he knows for a fact now that when it comes

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:03.800
down to techniques, his limitless is far better.

00:16:03.800 --> 00:16:07.389
Having been able to consistently overpower
Sukuna’s sure hit effect with his use of

00:16:07.389 --> 00:16:13.040
RCT, Gojo just like what everyone had expected,
makes a dash for the exit.

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:16.709
Sukuna immediately makes a dash to keep up
with him while remarking that he isn't just

00:16:16.709 --> 00:16:17.709
gonna let him escape.

00:16:17.709 --> 00:16:22.139
Grabbing his leg though Gojo still while constantly
getting slashed, pulls him in and knee’s

00:16:22.139 --> 00:16:23.139
Sukuna into the floor.

00:16:23.139 --> 00:16:27.300
Towering over him, Gojo attempts to land a
curse energy infused overhand, but misses

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:31.670
only cracking the floor as Sukuna quickly
manages to weasel his way out.

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:35.140
Standing there and looking at his opponent,
Sukuna remarks that Gojo’s still moving

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:39.550
pretty well considering he’s been activating
his reversed cursed technique at full output

00:16:39.550 --> 00:16:42.269
in order to survive the constantly slashing.

00:16:42.269 --> 00:16:46.820
Gojo on the otherhand, notices something extremely
important, to him it looks like Malevolent

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:50.339
Shrine itself is the heart of the domain,
not Sukuna.

00:16:50.339 --> 00:16:54.650
Back inside of the headquarters, Yuji ponders
what would happen if someone destroyed the

00:16:54.650 --> 00:16:56.860
shrine?

00:16:56.860 --> 00:17:01.269
The big brain, Kusakabe brings up that objects
inside of domains don't tend to hold any special

00:17:01.269 --> 00:17:06.089
meaning or significance, so think of it as
if it wasn't even there.

00:17:06.089 --> 00:17:10.100
Mei san thinks that if it is a symbol of the
domain, then you wouldn't even be able to

00:17:10.100 --> 00:17:14.620
destroy it and even considering Gojo’s inside
skills, it doesn't look like he’s taken

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:17.220
any measures to destroy it.

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:21.990
Suddenly Gojo activates the New Shadow Style,
Simple Domain taking Kusakabe by surprise

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:24.390
as he probably didnt expect it.

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:29.360
Yuji though noted that Gojo said one time
he could use it, but wasn't able to teach

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:30.360
it.

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:33.990
During the battle he was able to use his simple
domain to counter the sure hit effect while

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:38.119
simultaneously using RCT to heal his body.

00:17:38.119 --> 00:17:43.720
Confused Yuji wonders how one even manipulates
there own cursed energy while RCT is active.

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:48.080
Again Gojo activates another use of the Simple
Domain before darting at Sukuna and attempting

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:49.080
to strike him.

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:53.169
In an instant he’s once again pounded by
the sure hit effect, layering Gojo with a

00:17:53.169 --> 00:17:54.929
plethora of cuts.

00:17:54.929 --> 00:18:00.960
AGAIN he activates another use of simple domain
and RCT causing Sukuna to call this all a

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:02.300
bit tedious.

00:18:02.300 --> 00:18:06.350
Randomly though everyone back at headquarters
is taken by surprise when they see Gojo start

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:10.809
attacking Sukuna once more without using RCT
to heal himself.

00:18:10.809 --> 00:18:15.870
Someone wonders if he’s running low on cursed
energy, but Yuta refutes it as there is frankly

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:19.870
no limit to Gojo’s cursed energy.

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:24.309
Speaking up though, Ino mentions that like
he said before the assumption rate could be

00:18:24.309 --> 00:18:25.309
off.

00:18:25.309 --> 00:18:30.940
Right after Domain expansion he started using
RCT at max output which uses up twice as much

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:36.070
cursed energy and thats not even taking into
account the fact Sukuna is also rushing Gojo

00:18:36.070 --> 00:18:37.190
himself.

00:18:37.190 --> 00:18:43.050
With the two powerhouses of the series rushing
at each other and the cuts not stopping, everyone

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:45.790
wonders if Gojo is about to lose.

00:18:45.790 --> 00:18:49.640
Jumping on Sukuna and wrapping his hands around
the back of his head, Gojo activates Cursed

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:53.810
Technique Reversal, before leaning back and
pulling his hand up in preparation to end

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:55.059
the fight.

00:18:55.059 --> 00:18:58.240
Blown away with what he’s just witnessed,
Yuta wonders if its even possible.

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:02.941
In his mind the reason he wasn't able to heal
himself for a moment was because he was using

00:19:02.941 --> 00:19:06.460
RCT to heal his exhausted cursed technique.

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:10.539
Unleashing Red, Gojo shoots forth a blast
of reverse curse technique propelling Sukuna

00:19:10.539 --> 00:19:14.250
back into the Shrine that makes up the center
of his Domain.

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:19.190
Noting that he somehow managed to survive
the blast, Gojo activates RCT to heal and

00:19:19.190 --> 00:19:23.130
jokes that damn this dudes a pain in the ass.

00:19:23.130 --> 00:19:27.340
Going more in-depth on the unfathomable feat
Gojo just did, Yuta explains that a cursed

00:19:27.340 --> 00:19:30.790
technique which has been burned out by using
Domain Expansions is an entirely different

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:32.630
matter than physical damage.

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:37.371
Its like when a machine overheats, if it isn't
broken you have to let it cool down or it

00:19:37.371 --> 00:19:39.000
wont work again.

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:44.500
Interpreting this, Maki makes it easier to
understand by saying that RCT can repair damage

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:46.490
but cant help with the cooling effect.

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:51.789
However it looks as if this understanding
of the ability is wrong.

00:19:51.789 --> 00:19:56.169
Back in Shinjuku and having made it out of
the effective range, Gojo asks if Sukuna is

00:19:56.169 --> 00:19:58.289
able to expand the size of his area?

00:19:58.289 --> 00:20:04.440
Not even giving Gojo a second to think, Sukuna
expands the size of Malevolent Shrines Domain

00:20:04.440 --> 00:20:05.440
to its maximum.

00:20:05.440 --> 00:20:11.580
In the same moment, Gojo to the shock of everyone
expanded Infinite Void for a second time!

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:15.320
With everyone watching, they wonder if he’s
really dumb enough to just fall into the same

00:20:15.320 --> 00:20:16.440
trap as before.

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:23.000
Mei notices it first though and Higuruma who
btw for a new sorcerer is so big brain, states

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:27.799
that he switched conditions on the external
and internal conditions of his barrier.

00:20:27.799 --> 00:20:32.480
Which in simple enough terms for myself and
Yuji to understand, means that Gojo this time

00:20:32.480 --> 00:20:36.890
is able to protect itself against attacks
from the outside.

00:20:36.890 --> 00:20:41.169
Re-initiating the battle once more, both Gojo
and Sukuna trade hands back and forth, but

00:20:41.169 --> 00:20:44.580
not once do the hits end up landing on either
side.

00:20:44.580 --> 00:20:48.860
Jumping back, Gojo is absolutely blown away
as he understands that somehow Sukuna was

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:53.110
able to use his domain expansion and amplification
at the same time.

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:57.130
On top of that he’s becoming comfortable
inside of the infinite void and his cursed

00:20:57.130 --> 00:20:58.910
energy output is increasing.

00:20:58.910 --> 00:21:04.770
So in usual jujutsu combat you cannot use
an innate technique that’s etched into your

00:21:04.770 --> 00:21:07.130
body while using Domain Amp.

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:11.940
But if you go and imbue your domain with a
technique itself then its an entirely new

00:21:11.940 --> 00:21:12.940
situation.

00:21:12.940 --> 00:21:17.520
Throwing a punch, Sukuna manages to dodge
back out of the way, however as he pushes

00:21:17.520 --> 00:21:21.440
trying to strike Gojo, the six eyes manic
manages to evade the strike and thump the

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:23.490
side of Sukuna's body.

00:21:23.490 --> 00:21:27.100
Managing to spin out of Gojo’s sight, he
quickly understands that somehow and while

00:21:27.100 --> 00:21:30.720
inside of his own domain Sukuna turned off
his sure hit effect.

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:35.570
Knowing that the only ones who are unaffected
by infinite void are Gojo and anyone he touches,

00:21:35.570 --> 00:21:39.200
Sukuna's plan is to expand his effective range
and increase the power of the binding vow

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:41.960
even further than he did in Shibuya with Megumi.

00:21:41.960 --> 00:21:46.390
By using a binding vow, Sukuna is able to
further increase the power of his domain outside

00:21:46.390 --> 00:21:47.840
of Gojo’s domain.

00:21:47.840 --> 00:21:52.059
He does that by removing his sure hit guarantee
inside of the domain, while simultaneously

00:21:52.059 --> 00:21:55.230
also keeping himself safe from infinite void
by touching Gojo.

00:21:55.230 --> 00:22:00.770
Due to this all and again just like last time,
Gojo’s domain collapses and followed by

00:22:00.770 --> 00:22:04.350
a plethora of strikes that seemingly knock
him away from Sukuna.

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:08.580
With everyone back at the TV station headquarters
place, whatever it is I honestly don't have

00:22:08.580 --> 00:22:15.480
a clue, react in horror to what's going on,
Kashimo states that if Gojo dies he is going

00:22:15.480 --> 00:22:18.850
out to fight next, so don't even try stop
him.

00:22:18.850 --> 00:22:23.190
Over in Shinjuku, Gojo activates another technique
that he notes he hasn't used much since he

00:22:23.190 --> 00:22:25.440
mastered his domain.

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:30.850
Kusakabe spits out his smoke in awe of having
seen Gojo use falling blossom emotion.

00:22:30.850 --> 00:22:39.500
For those who forgot, its a secret art of
the big three families, an anti-domain technique.

00:22:39.500 --> 00:22:44.720
All in all its an application of cursed energy
that automatically repels anything you touch.

00:22:44.720 --> 00:22:48.940
It wouldn't ever be able to do something against
a complex domain like Infinite Void, but if

00:22:48.940 --> 00:22:52.559
you’re up against something simple like
slashes its pretty useful.

00:22:52.559 --> 00:22:56.580
Jumping in, Shoko just says that he most likely
used it so he can heal his burned out cursed

00:22:56.580 --> 00:22:59.850
technique or at the least by some time.

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:04.610
AGAIN though like what is this the 3rd time
now, Gojo blows them all away as he activates

00:23:04.610 --> 00:23:06.390
another use of Infinite Void.

00:23:06.390 --> 00:23:11.029
Unlike all of the previous uses though, this
time its completely massive in comparison

00:23:11.029 --> 00:23:15.179
and in Kashimo’s eyes it looks as if Gojo’s
trying to encapsulated all of Sukuna's domain

00:23:15.179 --> 00:23:16.900
within his barrier.

00:23:16.900 --> 00:23:20.779
Mei thinks its a bad move trying to expand
a domain to this size as it’ll drastically

00:23:20.779 --> 00:23:25.390
lower its effectiveness and like Higuruma
states even if the domain isn't destroyed

00:23:25.390 --> 00:23:27.890
its still pointless unless he wins inside.

00:23:27.890 --> 00:23:32.580
Suddenly Gojo’s Domain cracks, putting everyone
watching on edge and making them think that

00:23:32.580 --> 00:23:34.010
its about to fail.

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:38.200
Momo though quickly speaks up that no, its
not broken, infact the barrier is quickly

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:42.419
changing size and now its only a fraction
of its original size.

00:23:42.419 --> 00:23:47.120
With Gojo’s Domain only the size of like
a basketball now, Kusakabe remarks that this

00:23:47.120 --> 00:23:51.440
is frankly impossible, causing Mei to joke
about how many times they’ve said those

00:23:51.440 --> 00:23:52.440
words today.

00:23:52.440 --> 00:23:57.309
Maki curiously questions its outward appearance
and if the inside is that of a similar size.

00:23:57.309 --> 00:24:01.600
Kusakabe agree’s with her as thats why when
your usually trapped inside you cant get out

00:24:01.600 --> 00:24:03.760
unless you find the edge.

00:24:03.760 --> 00:24:07.941
Even if you find that edge a normal domain
is resistant to attacks from the inside, so

00:24:07.941 --> 00:24:10.220
escape is still limited.

00:24:10.220 --> 00:24:14.220
What's most important when it comes to a barrier
technique is a concrete image.

00:24:14.220 --> 00:24:18.390
Usually if you tried to envision a barrier
to small to hold yourself and an opponent,

00:24:18.390 --> 00:24:19.809
it would just collapse.

00:24:19.809 --> 00:24:23.460
Just like the prison realm though and probably
due to his time being confined in a small

00:24:23.460 --> 00:24:29.140
place, its now allowing him to implement a
similar thing during the battle.

00:24:29.140 --> 00:24:33.110
Still Kusakabe cant grasp the process around
how he’s able to change the conditions of

00:24:33.110 --> 00:24:35.520
his domain each time he uses it.

00:24:35.520 --> 00:24:40.559
Barriers particularly domain barriers typically
have a set internal and external parameter.

00:24:40.559 --> 00:24:45.550
By discovering their own blend of these parameters,
every sorcerer is able to establish their

00:24:45.550 --> 00:24:46.550
domain.

00:24:46.550 --> 00:24:51.450
Confused as obviously this wasn't how Higuruma
and Hakari figured out their domains, they

00:24:51.450 --> 00:24:54.130
open by default as a part of their technique.

00:24:54.130 --> 00:24:58.150
In any case, they aren't usually things that
can be changed easily.

00:24:58.150 --> 00:25:01.630
Kusakabe ponders if he changed the size of
his domain because it was to difficult to

00:25:01.630 --> 00:25:05.880
maintain the large surface mass, so he had
to compress it to make things easier.

00:25:05.880 --> 00:25:09.481
Or maybe it was because he wanted to see if
he could cover all of malevolent shrine with

00:25:09.481 --> 00:25:11.370
an even larger barrier.

00:25:11.370 --> 00:25:15.830
With Gojo’s domain beginning to shake back
and forth at such tremendous speed, the earth

00:25:15.830 --> 00:25:17.710
itself begins to rumble.

00:25:17.710 --> 00:25:22.580
Mei points out that even still Gojo’s domain
has managed to hold and Yuta states that Sukuna

00:25:22.580 --> 00:25:26.580
also decreased his domain so he could increase
the output of his cursed technique.

00:25:26.580 --> 00:25:31.940
So now pretty much, if this version of Gojo’s
barrier breaks they’ll enter a stalemate,

00:25:31.940 --> 00:25:37.130
however Gojo will be on the backfoot, as he
will begin to run out of options.

00:25:37.130 --> 00:25:42.020
Flashing back over to Shinjuku, Sadly once
more Gojo’s Domain is again shattered and

00:25:42.020 --> 00:25:50.620
Sukuna emerges victorious for a 3rd time in
the domain struggle.

00:25:50.620 --> 00:25:55.440
Having watched his sensei re-appear, Yuji
screams out for him, however in that moment

00:25:55.440 --> 00:26:00.010
all of the other sorcerers are flabbergasted
as they witness Sukuna’s Malevolent Shrine,

00:26:00.010 --> 00:26:01.950
start to crumble and fall to pieces.

00:26:01.950 --> 00:26:06.169
On top of that, its shown that at some point
throughout the domain struggle, Gojo was able

00:26:06.169 --> 00:26:10.580
to land a clean blow to the chest of Sukuna,
causing the king of curses to finally take

00:26:10.580 --> 00:26:11.990
some proper damage.

00:26:11.990 --> 00:26:16.600
Seeing this over their monitors, all of the
sorcerers scream in joy, believing that Gojo

00:26:16.600 --> 00:26:19.460
still has a chance in this battle.

00:26:19.460 --> 00:26:24.430
It was actually simultaneous, at the same
time Sukuna destroyed Gojo’s domain from

00:26:24.430 --> 00:26:30.750
the outside, Gojo destroyed Sukuna’s domain
to the point he couldn't maintain it any longer.

00:26:30.750 --> 00:26:37.370
Yelling at Miwa, Kusakabe asks if she kept
track, or if anyone kept track of the time

00:26:37.370 --> 00:26:39.640
that Gojo’s barrier was active.

00:26:39.640 --> 00:26:44.350
Speaking up, Mei reveals that it was out for
three minutes and 9 seconds, but if it was

00:26:44.350 --> 00:26:49.330
more specifically after the moment it minimized,
then that was exactly 3 minutes.

00:26:49.330 --> 00:26:53.390
Higuruma believes that now the domains have
collapsed neither of them will be able to

00:26:53.390 --> 00:26:54.940
use their cursed techniques anymore.

00:26:54.940 --> 00:26:59.890
If that is the case, Maki thinks Gojo can
make the first move since he can restore his

00:26:59.890 --> 00:27:02.740
burnt out technique just like before.

00:27:02.740 --> 00:27:08.300
But sadly Sukuna can also do the same with
RCT, and speaking up himself Yuta theorizes

00:27:08.300 --> 00:27:14.940
he could probably do it to, though like he
said earlier, it cant be used to heal a burnt

00:27:14.940 --> 00:27:19.410
out technique.

00:27:19.410 --> 00:27:24.230
The reason that Gojo showing this to Sukuna
is terrible problem for everyone is because

00:27:24.230 --> 00:27:29.120
back in the past Sukuna was able to split
his spirit 20 times into 20 different objects

00:27:29.120 --> 00:27:30.150
called fingers.

00:27:30.150 --> 00:27:35.899
After seeing this technique just once, Sukuna
learned how to turn himself into a cursed

00:27:35.899 --> 00:27:40.151
object and now that he’s seen this new ability,
its most likely he’ll also be able to restore

00:27:40.151 --> 00:27:42.149
his burnt out cursed technique.

00:27:42.149 --> 00:27:46.590
In Shinjuku, Sukuna boosts his way up onto
a bridge, giving him a moment of peace before

00:27:46.590 --> 00:27:50.240
noticing that random parts of the road start
to get smashed up from below.

00:27:50.240 --> 00:27:55.230
Quickly jumping of the bridge and up onto
some railing, Sukuna notices Gojo break his

00:27:55.230 --> 00:28:00.260
way through the ground behind him, then turning
back realizes his escape route was blocked

00:28:00.260 --> 00:28:03.940
by a ball of rocks that Gojo had perfectly
floated there.

00:28:03.940 --> 00:28:09.010
With no where to go Sukuna throws up his hands
to block and takes a kick that sends him sliding

00:28:09.010 --> 00:28:10.460
back along the sidewalk.

00:28:10.460 --> 00:28:14.610
Taking a moment to think about the fight,
Gojo wonders why Sukuna has been stubbornly

00:28:14.610 --> 00:28:18.179
avoiding using any other cursed technique
than his own.

00:28:18.179 --> 00:28:21.299
Even when the strength of the barrier was
lowered and Gojo had flipped the conditions

00:28:21.299 --> 00:28:23.779
of it, he didnt try to destroy it from the
inside.

00:28:23.779 --> 00:28:25.929
Instead he took the riskier option.

00:28:25.929 --> 00:28:29.860
While they cancelled out each others sure
hit effects from within the domain, Sukuna

00:28:29.860 --> 00:28:34.640
had no other choice but to use domain amplification
in order to beat his limitless cursed technique.

00:28:34.640 --> 00:28:37.660
Which was a massive advantage for out man.

00:28:37.660 --> 00:28:42.750
Still as he saw earlier, within a domain,
Sukuna is unable to use buildings to attack.

00:28:42.750 --> 00:28:47.260
Infact until after Gojo’s domain was destroyed
he technically had the upper hand for over

00:28:47.260 --> 00:28:48.260
3 minutes.

00:28:48.260 --> 00:28:52.880
Yet in spite of that he cant seem to understand
why Sukuna didnt ever attempt to use something

00:28:52.880 --> 00:28:56.450
from the ten shadows technique or Mahoraga
while in a domain.

00:28:56.450 --> 00:29:00.770
He has the memory of Megumi and the conversation
that happened between them, so he knows for

00:29:00.770 --> 00:29:05.190
a fact that someone of the exact same power
died to him.

00:29:05.190 --> 00:29:10.110
Gojo just ponders if he’s scared he’ll
beat Mahoraga in once shot, however in that

00:29:10.110 --> 00:29:14.779
exact moment, the wheel turns and blood begins
to drip from his own nose.

00:29:14.779 --> 00:29:19.559
fug a nosebleed though, damn Gojo was baiting
our ass with that one and in an instant both

00:29:19.559 --> 00:29:23.429
him and Sukuna threw up their hands to perform
another domain clash.

00:29:23.429 --> 00:29:27.920
Yuji points out that again they activated
at the same time, and Angel who’s right

00:29:27.920 --> 00:29:31.620
next to him brings up that Sukuna can now
restored his burnt out cursed technique or

00:29:31.620 --> 00:29:34.880
maybe just decided to hide the use until now.

00:29:34.880 --> 00:29:38.240
Kusakabe knows that within the next three
minutes that it should take for Sukuna to

00:29:38.240 --> 00:29:42.269
destroy Gojo’s domain from the outside,
Gojo will need to damage Sukuna to the point

00:29:42.269 --> 00:29:44.909
he cant maintain his domain.

00:29:44.909 --> 00:29:49.659
Shoko joking that they shouldn't take as if
Gojo is on the backfoot yet brings up that

00:29:49.659 --> 00:29:53.870
if Sukuna is hit at all by unlimited void
then mans done.

00:29:53.870 --> 00:29:58.929
Due to this its certain that if Gojo is able
to destroy Malevolent Shrine within the next

00:29:58.929 --> 00:30:02.360
3 minutes then Gojo will win this battle.

00:30:02.360 --> 00:30:06.470
Inside of Shinjuku and having flared up his
cursed energy fists, Gojo pounds Sukuna with

00:30:06.470 --> 00:30:10.560
a barrage of punches that really only bruise
the king of curses arms.

00:30:10.560 --> 00:30:14.279
Jumping up Sukuna tries to quickly get over
to his shrine, however he’s knocked into

00:30:14.279 --> 00:30:19.190
the floor then while incapacitated is grabed
by Gojo’s infinity and pulled towards himself.

00:30:19.190 --> 00:30:24.630
Having been flung towards Gojo, Sukuna just
manages to block a devestating stomach punch.

00:30:24.630 --> 00:30:28.990
Randomly though and im assuming mans used
Yuji’s divergent punch to delay the hit

00:30:28.990 --> 00:30:32.809
of his cursed energy, Sukuna’s malevolent
shrine is completely destroyed while in the

00:30:32.809 --> 00:30:36.420
exact same moment again, Gojos domain also
ends.

00:30:36.420 --> 00:30:40.520
Falling to the ground and looking up, its
evident that this time Sukuna took a serious

00:30:40.520 --> 00:30:44.900
blow as half of his face appears to currently
be missing.

00:30:44.900 --> 00:30:48.950
With everyone believing that when it comes
down to domain struggles, Gojo is stronger,

00:30:48.950 --> 00:30:52.280
they all hope deep within themselves that
he can win.

00:30:52.280 --> 00:30:57.340
Throwing a fat right hook, Gojo sends Sukuna
straight back into the side of a bridge pillar

00:30:57.340 --> 00:30:59.260
breaking it in the process.

00:30:59.260 --> 00:31:02.899
Idek what we’re at now, like this is utterly
insane.

00:31:02.899 --> 00:31:06.500
AGAIN Gojo and Sukuna launch another set of
domain struggles.

00:31:06.500 --> 00:31:12.740
Yet unlike all of the previous battles, somethings
different here and Yuta cant help but feel

00:31:12.740 --> 00:31:17.780
like maybe, just maybe, Gojo was able to expand
his domain earlier.

00:31:17.780 --> 00:31:21.970
Inside of the domain struggle its revealed,
that Sukuna was indeed busy healing his body

00:31:21.970 --> 00:31:25.059
and because of that he was late restoring
his cursed technique.

00:31:25.059 --> 00:31:30.370
It was less that 0.01 seconds, but unlimited
void landed.

00:31:30.370 --> 00:31:34.840
As an infinite set of infinite information
rushes into the cerebral cortex of histories

00:31:34.840 --> 00:31:37.030
strongest sorcerer and the king of curses.

00:31:37.030 --> 00:31:42.070
Our man, todays current demon, rushes forth
and pierces the chest of darkness incarnate.

00:31:42.070 --> 00:31:46.860
Crazily enough, only 2 minutes and 40 seconds
after they last expanded their domains, Gojo

00:31:46.860 --> 00:31:49.850
was able to collapse Malevolent shrine within
his innate compound.

00:31:49.850 --> 00:31:55.030
With nothing, not even the friction in the
air available for Sukuna to use, he stands

00:31:55.030 --> 00:32:00.909
there dumbfounded as the full effect of Satoru
Gojo’s infinite void connects with his body.

00:32:00.909 --> 00:32:06.049
Not done yet himself, Gojo lets everyone know
that crushing his heart was only the beginning,

00:32:06.049 --> 00:32:08.639
now he’s gonna take everything from him.

00:32:08.639 --> 00:32:14.049
However before he’s able to connect with
Sukuna, a set of prolific words are spoken.

00:32:14.049 --> 00:32:16.429
With this treasure, I summon...

00:32:16.429 --> 00:32:21.360
Eight Handled Sword Divergent Sila Divine
General Mahoraga!

00:32:21.360 --> 00:32:25.880
Skitzing out with the fact Sukuna managed
to summon him in that moment, Gojo just assumes

00:32:25.880 --> 00:32:31.149
it hast had time to adapt to unlimited void
yet so surely he can destroy it in one shot.

00:32:31.149 --> 00:32:35.100
Activating cursed technique reversal, Gojo
is just baffled when he witnesses Mahoraga

00:32:35.100 --> 00:32:39.870
literally not care and instead with the sword
of extermination slashes down, completely

00:32:39.870 --> 00:32:42.210
destroying Gojo’s infinite Void.

00:32:42.210 --> 00:32:47.150
Falling to the ground, Gojo can only gasp
as he realizes that somehow Mahoraga had already

00:32:47.150 --> 00:32:52.340
adapted to his domain expansion, allowing
him to attack freely from the inside.

00:32:52.340 --> 00:32:56.000
Realizing that Mahoraga has been summoned,
Choso points out that it has the ability to

00:32:56.000 --> 00:32:58.539
adapt to any attack, even unlimited void.

00:32:58.539 --> 00:33:03.799
Using Reverse Curse technique and with Mahoraga
by his side, Sukuna knows that Gojo was well

00:33:03.799 --> 00:33:05.460
aware of the shikigami’s abilities.

00:33:05.460 --> 00:33:10.059
In this battle so far, both of the guys have
had their domains cancel each others out a

00:33:10.059 --> 00:33:11.830
total of 5 times.

00:33:11.830 --> 00:33:16.380
Gojo’s sire hit effect targeted everything
within the domain, whereas Sukuna’s sure

00:33:16.380 --> 00:33:21.019
hit effect targeted everything inside his
domain, with the exception of himself.

00:33:21.019 --> 00:33:25.419
This means that the sure hit effect targeting
Sukuna was still in place.

00:33:25.419 --> 00:33:30.279
Crazily enough, one of the duo was able to
take on unlimited void 5 times, all while

00:33:30.279 --> 00:33:33.360
shouldering the burden of Mahoraga’s adaption.

00:33:33.360 --> 00:33:37.200
This person wasn't Sukuna though, no, it was
instead someone else.

00:33:37.200 --> 00:33:41.990
Blown away with this revelation, Gojo quickly
figures that somehow he managed to adapt to

00:33:41.990 --> 00:33:45.840
unlimited void within 0.01 seconds of his
domain opening.

00:33:45.840 --> 00:33:51.399
Doing some more crazy deductions he figures
that like I said somehow Sukuna overcame the

00:33:51.399 --> 00:33:56.060
burden of Mahoraga’s adaption ability, then
realizing he’s wrong he states that the

00:33:56.060 --> 00:33:58.960
one actually taking the damage, was Megumi’s
Soul.

00:33:58.960 --> 00:34:03.950
Deep into the conscious of Megumi’s mind,
we see him barely awake with Mahoraga’s

00:34:03.950 --> 00:34:06.659
wheel floating directly above him.

00:34:06.659 --> 00:34:12.230
Seeing Gojo now and wondering what's on his
mind, Sukuna asks what up, to which Gojo says

00:34:12.230 --> 00:34:13.230
nothing really.

00:34:13.230 --> 00:34:16.780
It just warms his heart to see him using such
fraudulent abilities.

00:34:16.780 --> 00:34:21.201
Replying to this underhanded diss, Sukuna
states that unlimited void is an ability that

00:34:21.201 --> 00:34:23.480
Gojo activates once inside of his domain.

00:34:23.480 --> 00:34:29.770
He originally expected it to be a pain figuring
this out, and initially he planned to do neutralize

00:34:29.770 --> 00:34:31.050
it first.

00:34:31.050 --> 00:34:35.560
So while unable to use amplification within
the domain, Sukuna used Megumi’s soul to

00:34:35.560 --> 00:34:39.089
adapt to unlimited void using his own ten
shadows technique.

00:34:39.089 --> 00:34:42.879
As a result he wasn't able to use anything
other than what was originally imbued into

00:34:42.879 --> 00:34:44.570
his domain.

00:34:44.570 --> 00:34:50.869
Knowing that all Megumi took then was the
process of adaption, Gojo begins pulling up

00:34:50.869 --> 00:34:55.070
his hand and remarking that Sukuna hasn't
actually adapted Megumi’s soul itself to

00:34:55.070 --> 00:35:01.119
unlimited void, and if he opens his domain
once more, he’ll destroy him in one attack.

00:35:01.119 --> 00:35:05.680
Not fazed over this though, Sukuna just laughs
and taunts Gojo while telling him that he’s

00:35:05.680 --> 00:35:08.350
no longer able to open his domain.

00:35:08.350 --> 00:35:12.349
Instantly and as he tries activating it once
more, blood begins streaming from his nose

00:35:12.349 --> 00:35:16.670
and everyone back at headquarters, still watching
the monitors begin freaking out over the possible

00:35:16.670 --> 00:35:34.349
outcome.

00:35:34.349 --> 00:35:38.910
Having found a way in now, Sukuna remarks
that using RCT to heal his exhausted innate

00:35:38.910 --> 00:35:42.339
technique looks to have strained his physical
brain quiet a bit.

00:35:42.339 --> 00:35:47.970
To him its evident that his brain, more specifically
the prefrontal cortex where information on

00:35:47.970 --> 00:35:53.650
cursed techniques is located, has been destroyed
and repaired too many times using RCT to heal

00:35:53.650 --> 00:36:05.310
his burnt out technique.

00:36:05.310 --> 00:36:09.670
Terrorfied at the fact Gojo had been using
such a wild technique, Yuta just screams that

00:36:09.670 --> 00:36:11.070
this is way to risky.

00:36:11.070 --> 00:36:15.210
They all know that the brain, especially that
section of the brain is the most important

00:36:15.210 --> 00:36:19.160
and you cant even compare it to simply repairing
someone's normal bodily damage.

00:36:19.160 --> 00:36:24.839
Shoko speaks up nervous over the fact she
assumed Gojo had got used to this effect on

00:36:24.839 --> 00:36:26.690
his brain, however it looks like he’s suffering
now.

00:36:26.690 --> 00:36:32.060
To top that off, Sukuna has done it fewer
times so he’s in a much healthier battle

00:36:32.060 --> 00:36:33.090
condition.

00:36:33.090 --> 00:36:37.610
Back in Shinjuku and as Gojo drops to one
knee, Sukuna states that Gojo has reached

00:36:37.610 --> 00:36:38.750
his limit.

00:36:38.750 --> 00:36:43.090
Even if he could've expanded his domain again,
he would've lost the instant he did.

00:36:43.090 --> 00:36:46.920
Not to mention the fact, that he wouldn't
even be able to make it precise enough to

00:36:46.920 --> 00:36:48.770
be a threat.

00:36:48.770 --> 00:36:53.251
Taunting him like the demon he truly is, Sukuna
lets Gojo know that next up he’ll bring

00:36:53.251 --> 00:36:57.440
the circumference of his domain inwards, from
there he’ll be left with no where to run

00:36:57.440 --> 00:37:01.869
and as he carves him up, he’ll simultaneously
adapt to his infinity.

00:37:01.869 --> 00:37:06.619
Saying his final goodbyes, he states that
Gojo was born into an era without Sukuna and

00:37:06.619 --> 00:37:08.390
was hailed as the strongest.

00:37:08.390 --> 00:37:13.980
Yet in the end, he just turned out to be plain-fully
ordinary.

00:37:13.980 --> 00:37:20.369
Saying those prolific words, DOMAIN EXPANSION,
Sukuna proceeds to unleash his domain, however

00:37:20.369 --> 00:37:25.040
in that moment all of his eyes begin bleeding
profusely and the domain fails.

00:37:25.040 --> 00:37:30.420
So crazily enough, from the time of the previous
domain, this last conversation happened in

00:37:30.420 --> 00:37:33.020
10 seconds, and yet just like Gojo.

00:37:33.020 --> 00:37:37.660
Sukuna’s brain had sustained enough damage
to now make an expansion impossible.

00:37:37.660 --> 00:37:41.940
Jumping up and laughing at Sukuna, Gojo just
notes that it looks like its hitting him pretty

00:37:41.940 --> 00:37:42.940
hard now.

00:37:42.940 --> 00:37:46.700
Then pointing at Mei’s crows, he knows that
all of his students are watching him put his

00:37:46.700 --> 00:37:51.140
life on the line, so he’s gonna go ahead
and keep showing off.

00:37:51.140 --> 00:37:55.819
Jumping forth with a speed Sukuna is unable
to keep up with, Gojo throws a fat right hook

00:37:55.819 --> 00:38:00.130
to let his opponent know he still has a long
way to go to defeat him.

00:38:00.130 --> 00:38:04.850
Over inside the main groups hideout, Kusakabe
asks who there had been seriously punched

00:38:04.850 --> 00:38:05.880
by Gojo before.

00:38:05.880 --> 00:38:10.520
A few people speak up noting that well he
didnt hit them, but they tried to punch him

00:38:10.520 --> 00:38:13.210
as hard as they could and it was physically
impossible.

00:38:13.210 --> 00:38:19.680
Due to no one having taken a hit, Kusakabe
who im assuming has, says that his fists are

00:38:19.680 --> 00:38:24.730
enhanced with cursed energy and on the moment
of impact, blue repeatedly absorbs the surrounding

00:38:24.730 --> 00:38:25.730
space.

00:38:25.730 --> 00:38:29.990
It feels as if you’ve been counterattacked
after preparing for a regular blow.

00:38:29.990 --> 00:38:35.150
Kirara wonders if it hurt, and Hakari along
with Yuta both reveal they puked after the

00:38:35.150 --> 00:38:36.150
hit they took.

00:38:36.150 --> 00:38:41.270
Nanami once said to Yuji that if he planned
on continuing as a sorcerer, then he shouldn't

00:38:41.270 --> 00:38:43.050
compare himself to Gojo.

00:38:43.050 --> 00:38:48.630
Nanami puts a massive deal of effort behind
his critical hits, but Gojo can casually perform

00:38:48.630 --> 00:38:52.630
them as if its an everyday thing.

00:38:52.630 --> 00:38:56.560
What Kusakabe was mainly trying to explains
was that from here on out, when it comes to

00:38:56.560 --> 00:38:59.830
straight hands, he doesn't have a clue what
Gojo’s doing.

00:38:59.830 --> 00:39:04.690
Back in Shinjuku its shown that Gojo is completely
dominating Sukuna in a physical fight.

00:39:04.690 --> 00:39:08.690
He boosts down a building while smashing Sukuna
into every level, before turning around and

00:39:08.690 --> 00:39:10.010
tossing him over to the road.

00:39:10.010 --> 00:39:14.490
When Sukuna lands, Gojo uses all of the rubble
that had broken away from the building to

00:39:14.490 --> 00:39:17.240
entrap the king of curses inside a brick coffin.

00:39:17.240 --> 00:39:21.310
Exploding out of the reinforced brick, Sukuna
darts forth and quickly ducks a head kick

00:39:21.310 --> 00:39:22.310
from Gojo.

00:39:22.310 --> 00:39:26.670
Getting caught under in his trap, Gojo slams
his leg down, only to see Sukuna flip out

00:39:26.670 --> 00:39:29.140
of the way and prepare his own axe kick.

00:39:29.140 --> 00:39:33.210
All of a sudden he stops though, as he see’s
what seems like Gojo running at such a high

00:39:33.210 --> 00:39:36.120
speed its begun creating a circle of after
images.

00:39:36.120 --> 00:39:41.109
Thinking that he has the upperhand now, Gojo
darts in to strike, but Sukuna manages to

00:39:41.109 --> 00:39:45.350
spot the real image and grab his hand, before
following up and punching him straight in

00:39:45.350 --> 00:39:46.350
the face.

00:39:46.350 --> 00:39:50.870
Being sent backwards Gojo quickly regains
his orientation and lands atop a street light.

00:39:50.870 --> 00:39:56.190
Walking towards him, Sukuna explains that
Furu’s incantation, used to manifest Mahoraga,

00:39:56.190 --> 00:40:00.280
along with the wheel represents complete circulation
and harmony.

00:40:00.280 --> 00:40:04.560
Once Mahoraga has been attacked, the wheel
turns and the adaption begins.

00:40:04.560 --> 00:40:08.500
With that said, the wheel turns and Mahoraga
seemingly adapts.

00:40:08.500 --> 00:40:14.200
Gojo knows that when Sukuna uses domain amplification
and touches him, the wheel turns black.

00:40:14.200 --> 00:40:18.850
Its safe then in his eyes to assume that it
interrupts and adaption process.

00:40:18.850 --> 00:40:23.750
So if Sukuna cant activate his domain, but
can use amplification its probably because

00:40:23.750 --> 00:40:28.619
the area of his brain originally damaged was
in charge of barrier techniques.

00:40:28.619 --> 00:40:33.840
Over with Sukuna as he slowly strolls forth,
he thinks that Gojo is most likely only using

00:40:33.840 --> 00:40:38.690
Lapse to avoid having his other techniques
adapted, which makes perfect sense.

00:40:38.690 --> 00:40:42.640
As the lights go green, the two then rush
each other down once more, clashing in the

00:40:42.640 --> 00:40:43.870
middle of the road.

00:40:43.870 --> 00:40:48.540
With the light Gojo was just on, falling behind
Sukuna, he quickly grabs it and biffs it towards

00:40:48.540 --> 00:40:51.660
Gojo, however it freezes as the object connects
with his infinity.

00:40:51.660 --> 00:40:56.480
Back over with the main group they all note
that its random Mahoraga hasn't re-appeared.

00:40:56.480 --> 00:41:01.880
Mei supposed that it had already adapted once
unlimited void was used for a fifth time.

00:41:01.880 --> 00:41:06.589
Taking the knowledge in, Hakari deduces that
maybe the wheel has to turn a few times in

00:41:06.589 --> 00:41:10.020
order for Sukuna to adapt to Gojo’s limitless
technique.

00:41:10.020 --> 00:41:14.310
Just like they assumed and as Sukuna asked
if Gojo had been paying attention to his ability,

00:41:14.310 --> 00:41:19.660
our man explains that he needs four spins
in total, which technically means only 3 more

00:41:19.660 --> 00:41:24.100
spins of the wheel until Mahoraga adapts to
Gojo’s Infinity.

00:41:24.100 --> 00:41:28.230
Walking towards each other again, Sukuna jokes
that they now have a countdown to when Gojo’s

00:41:28.230 --> 00:41:32.369
idiotic smirk will be will be wiped from his
face, causing our goat to smile right back

00:41:32.369 --> 00:41:33.730
and tell him the same.

00:41:33.730 --> 00:41:38.920
In fact Gojo takes one step further saying
that he’ll beat him dead before he even

00:41:38.920 --> 00:41:41.130
makes it to the 3rd spin.

00:41:41.130 --> 00:41:45.600
Still eagerly watching the battle, Hana questions
if Gojo’s forgotten about Megumi to which

00:41:45.600 --> 00:41:48.400
Yuji say’s that man really might have.

00:41:48.400 --> 00:41:53.010
Hearing them and looking reading to throw
some hands himself, Kashimo jokes that its

00:41:53.010 --> 00:41:55.010
fine, let em forget Megumi.

00:41:55.010 --> 00:41:59.900
Needing to forget Megumi cause mans in a slightly
tight spot right now, Yuji watches as Mahoraga’s

00:41:59.900 --> 00:42:04.819
wheel spins for the second time, meaning that
theres only 2 more spins until Gojo’s infinity

00:42:04.819 --> 00:42:06.300
will be fully adapted to.

00:42:06.300 --> 00:42:11.099
Turning his hands into perfectly constructed
orbs of blue cursed energy, Gojo flings them

00:42:11.099 --> 00:42:14.570
at Sukuna, making him acrobatically flip out
of the way as the ability burns the bridge

00:42:14.570 --> 00:42:15.740
from existence.

00:42:15.740 --> 00:42:20.520
Capturing Sukuna within his range, Gojo sticks
both hands forth and creates more cursed energy

00:42:20.520 --> 00:42:23.939
orbs that circle his target leaving them with
no where to escape.

00:42:23.939 --> 00:42:27.630
Somehow escaping though, Sukuna managed to
duck down before darting off, causing all

00:42:27.630 --> 00:42:31.550
of the orbs to immediately change direction
and start tracking his new position.

00:42:31.550 --> 00:42:35.470
Boosting it around one of the nearby pillars,
Gojo fly's up and quickly blocks Sukuna’s

00:42:35.470 --> 00:42:39.109
kick, having gained the advantage now, he
follows up by kicking his opponent down towards

00:42:39.109 --> 00:42:40.280
the road below.

00:42:40.280 --> 00:42:44.540
While falling, the wheel spins for the 3rd
time, making everyone back at the TV room

00:42:44.540 --> 00:42:48.000
get more and more nervous over the impending
adaption.

00:42:48.000 --> 00:42:53.970
Yuji curiously wonders if its time thats needed
for the Wheel to adapt, or is it battle experience?

00:42:53.970 --> 00:42:58.200
Realizing what Yuji was trying to say, Kusakabe
solidifies his question by also pondering

00:42:58.200 --> 00:43:03.540
if A) Does it take one attack then time for
the wheel to understand then adapt or, B)

00:43:03.540 --> 00:43:06.400
is it adapting after taking multiple blows.

00:43:06.400 --> 00:43:10.530
Still not even sure himself, he points out
that Gojo hasn't used anything other than

00:43:10.530 --> 00:43:15.880
Lapse, so he doesn't even know and compounding
that Kashimo states that, either option is

00:43:15.880 --> 00:43:18.680
possible, thats the reality of this situation.

00:43:18.680 --> 00:43:22.400
Following the king of curses through one of
the nearby buildings windows, Gojo remarks

00:43:22.400 --> 00:43:24.819
that from now on he’s gonna give him HELL.

00:43:24.819 --> 00:43:29.720
In his eyes he’s convinced Sukuna that all
he’s using is blue, so with this timing

00:43:29.720 --> 00:43:31.690
he wont be able to react.

00:43:31.690 --> 00:43:35.570
Pulling up his hand and firing a point blank
shot of cursed technique reversal: red, Gojo

00:43:35.570 --> 00:43:41.270
just watches as the wheel turns black, signifying
that Sukuna had activated his domain amplification.

00:43:41.270 --> 00:43:45.470
As the technique hits and because of what
I previously just mentioned, Sukuna was just

00:43:45.470 --> 00:43:48.180
barely able to minimize the damage in time.

00:43:48.180 --> 00:43:53.530
Activating his RCT Sukuna to heal, Sukuna
thinks that he expected this, even if amplification

00:43:53.530 --> 00:43:58.130
can neutralize the low output of limitless,
it cant fully cancel out blue or the reversed

00:43:58.130 --> 00:43:59.130
red.

00:43:59.130 --> 00:44:03.720
Yuji and Kusakabe both react in abject horror
as they realize that at this rate Sukuna will

00:44:03.720 --> 00:44:05.790
fully adapt to his technique.

00:44:05.790 --> 00:44:10.560
Looking heavily beaten and bruised, Sukuna
turns around to remark that Gojo is sloppy,

00:44:10.560 --> 00:44:15.809
and questions if the greatest sorcerer of
today lost his cool once his hand was read.

00:44:15.809 --> 00:44:20.720
Randomly though Gojo doesn't attack instead
he just tells his opponent that, ya know the

00:44:20.720 --> 00:44:21.920
Red he just shot before.

00:44:21.920 --> 00:44:24.980
Well it hasn't even exploded yet.

00:44:24.980 --> 00:44:29.120
Taking one of the hardest back-shot's in the
figurative world that is Jujutsu Kaisen, Sukuna

00:44:29.120 --> 00:44:34.440
gasps in pain as he realizes that he, the
king of curses was taken from behind?

00:44:34.440 --> 00:44:38.300
Quickly calculating the buildings layout he
figures that Gojo must’ve planned from the

00:44:38.300 --> 00:44:40.890
start to have red strike after 1 full lap.

00:44:40.890 --> 00:44:45.380
Not giving him a chance to recover, Gojo follows
up and pounds Sukuna so damn hard with a black

00:44:45.380 --> 00:44:48.820
flash that it physically knocks him out for
a moment.

00:44:48.820 --> 00:44:52.140
Everyone back at the TV room just watches
in awe as they never even expected such an

00:44:52.140 --> 00:44:56.030
ability to land, let alone be as successful
as it was.

00:44:56.030 --> 00:45:00.480
Back in Shinjuku blood pours from Sukuna’s
mouth and the wheel falls symbolizing the

00:45:00.480 --> 00:45:03.310
defeat of histories strongest sorcerer.

00:45:03.310 --> 00:45:07.329
Randomly though the wheel picks up speed and
spins for the final time while at the exact

00:45:07.329 --> 00:45:12.410
same time a stunned Gojo falls into a pool
of darkness and Mahoraga’s demonic hands

00:45:12.410 --> 00:45:13.740
reach out for him.

00:45:13.740 --> 00:45:18.690
With nowhere to go, Mahoraga grabs Gojo and
slices his chest with the sword of extermination

00:45:18.690 --> 00:45:22.829
leaving everyone’s hope of survival on the
brink of destruction.

00:45:22.829 --> 00:45:26.470
Beads of sweat drip from everyone's heads
as they worry about how things have taken

00:45:26.470 --> 00:45:28.710
a turn for the worse with Gojo.

00:45:28.710 --> 00:45:33.880
Since Mahoraga has arrived it means he’s
now completely adapted to Gojo’s technique.

00:45:33.880 --> 00:45:38.440
Yuji however stays hopeful as in his eyes
Mahoraga only adapted to the infinity which

00:45:38.440 --> 00:45:44.410
means its only an equal fight now, and Gojo
can heal up right away using RCT.

00:45:44.410 --> 00:45:48.609
Standing nearby and looking absolutely stressed,
Shoko explains that she’s been smoking a

00:45:48.609 --> 00:45:50.559
ton during the battle.

00:45:50.559 --> 00:45:55.079
Sadly she thinks it isn't a case of just healing
up again, instead its more that Gojo’s healing

00:45:55.079 --> 00:45:59.369
is gradually becoming slower than usual due
to his extended use of RED.

00:45:59.369 --> 00:46:03.131
If the already prolonged fight continues it
might end up with him not being able to use

00:46:03.131 --> 00:46:07.820
his Cursed Technique Reversal to heal as quickly,
therefore he could lose.

00:46:07.820 --> 00:46:12.170
Though she does pose that the situation is
probably the same for Sukuna.

00:46:12.170 --> 00:46:13.960
Gojo’s opponent is the KING OF CURSES.

00:46:13.960 --> 00:46:18.190
Initially when the battle kicked off everyone
thought that it would be impossible for Gojo

00:46:18.190 --> 00:46:22.869
to win and now with what they’ve seen that
thought is slowly creeping back in.

00:46:22.869 --> 00:46:26.910
Even Gojo himself has begun thinking the same
thing.

00:46:26.910 --> 00:46:31.720
Wondering how long its been since he felt
like this, it reminds him of a battle 11 years

00:46:31.720 --> 00:46:36.930
earlier against Toji Fushiguro and how now
he’s beginning to feel the same satisfaction

00:46:36.930 --> 00:46:41.260
from fighting, thats pushing him to an even
higher degree throughout this battle.

00:46:41.260 --> 00:46:46.540
Being the strongest sadly comes with the title
of also being the loneliest and now the only

00:46:46.540 --> 00:46:48.780
thing that will truly satisfy him is pure
dominance.

00:46:48.780 --> 00:46:53.380
FLYING FORTH Gojo hits Mahoraga with a direct
punch that pushes the God shikigami back.

00:46:53.380 --> 00:46:57.190
Instantly following up he tries to activate
RED in order to finish him off, but Sukuna

00:46:57.190 --> 00:47:01.570
jumps back in and uses Megumi’s Rabbit escape
to cover Mahoraga and allow him to prepare

00:47:01.570 --> 00:47:03.020
for the next attack.

00:47:03.020 --> 00:47:07.300
Having watched his opponent try his best to
evade every attack, Gojo mocks Sukuna asking

00:47:07.300 --> 00:47:11.740
him how long he’s gonna rest for after taking
the black flash and that it was pretty obvious

00:47:11.740 --> 00:47:14.300
its effects are still hurting him.

00:47:14.300 --> 00:47:18.290
Suddenly Sukuna mixes things up and throws
a fire extinguisher to cover himself and make

00:47:18.290 --> 00:47:19.850
an opening for Mahoraga to attack Gojo.

00:47:19.850 --> 00:47:21.040
Bursting through Mahoraga appears and attempts
to attack Gojo from above.

00:47:21.040 --> 00:47:25.290
As Gojo is caught up in his fight with BIG
M, Sukuna uses a new application of Megumi’s

00:47:25.290 --> 00:47:29.370
Max Elephant Shikigami to shoot a blast of
water that mirrors Choso’s piecing blood

00:47:29.370 --> 00:47:30.370
technique.

00:47:30.370 --> 00:47:35.170
Just as Gojo defends against Mahoraga, Sukuna's
attack lands &amp; wounds his arm.

00:47:35.170 --> 00:47:38.840
Flying backwards, Gojo quickly realizes that
Sukuna is mainly waiting for his infinity

00:47:38.840 --> 00:47:44.630
ability to vanish, meaning that the fight
would turning into a pure 2 v 1 if it continues.

00:47:44.630 --> 00:47:48.990
Annoyed he wonders how Sukuna is even able
to use the abilities of the Shikigami without

00:47:48.990 --> 00:47:51.000
summoning them in the first place.

00:47:51.000 --> 00:47:55.130
Like Megumi has to go through his whole procedure
whereas Sukuna can wear the wheel and summon

00:47:55.130 --> 00:47:58.910
these Shikigami with what im assuming are
his thoughts.

00:47:58.910 --> 00:48:02.819
Gojo knows that since Sukuna was able to adapt
to his infinity ability, he’s gonna have

00:48:02.819 --> 00:48:07.530
to use more cursed energy, thats why he’s
been simultaneously using the Shikigami, however

00:48:07.530 --> 00:48:12.160
he does explain that if Sukuna wants to adapt
to RED it would take much longer to do so.

00:48:12.160 --> 00:48:16.089
Cutting his brainstorming off though, Sukuna
beams his way back into the picture while

00:48:16.089 --> 00:48:18.579
stating that this isn't a 1 v 2 numpty.

00:48:18.579 --> 00:48:20.160
Im the fraudulent one.

00:48:20.160 --> 00:48:25.530
Moving his hands together, Sukuna Summons
a brand new Shikigami called the CHIMERA BEAST:

00:48:25.530 --> 00:48:32.339
AGITO making this battle a 1 v 3 and putting
Gojo even further onto the back foot.

00:48:32.339 --> 00:48:38.800
According to what i've seen the Chimera beast
is a mixture of Nue and Totality, which is

00:48:38.800 --> 00:48:43.700
probably a combination I never ever saw coming,
and leaves sooo many other weird and hybrids

00:48:43.700 --> 00:48:47.710
up for creation.

00:48:47.710 --> 00:48:51.730
Gojo himself even jokes that with those 2
Giants standing there, Sukuna looks like a

00:48:51.730 --> 00:48:52.730
lost child.

00:48:52.730 --> 00:48:57.490
In a flash, the 2 beasts start the fight once
more with Gojo just barely being able to dodge

00:48:57.490 --> 00:48:59.200
the initial attacks.

00:48:59.200 --> 00:49:03.040
Randomly and stealing some more of Megumi’s
techniques, Sukuna pops out of Gojo's shadows

00:49:03.040 --> 00:49:07.130
with his hands aimed like a pistol and shoots
another water blast like piercing blood from

00:49:07.130 --> 00:49:10.130
Max Elephant’s ability but Gojo dodges that
too.

00:49:10.130 --> 00:49:14.470
Slamming his fist down, Gojo just misses as
Sukuna flips back out of the way allowing

00:49:14.470 --> 00:49:17.440
his boys to follow up with a dual hook punch
from either side.

00:49:17.440 --> 00:49:22.850
Somehow dodging and arriving behind Mahoraga,
Gojo proceeds to blast him with red but its

00:49:22.850 --> 00:49:26.040
barely even enough to burn the creature now.

00:49:26.040 --> 00:49:29.690
Figuring that mans probably stuffed if he
doesn't do something absolutely insane, Gojo

00:49:29.690 --> 00:49:34.330
deduces that he has to use this damn technique
in order to be able to finish Mahoraga off

00:49:34.330 --> 00:49:35.460
in one shot!

00:49:35.460 --> 00:49:40.950
Its a massive risk as Sukuna will most likely
notice the raised output, but its a risk he

00:49:40.950 --> 00:49:41.950
has to take.

00:49:41.950 --> 00:49:46.710
With a glimmer of hope and a cheeky grin on
his face, Gojo states that he’s got no other

00:49:46.710 --> 00:49:50.339
choice, its time to use the UNLIMTIED HOLLOW
TECHNIQUE!

00:49:50.339 --> 00:49:54.280
Well idk about everyone else here, but things
aint exactly looking good for Gojo at the

00:49:54.280 --> 00:49:55.280
moment.

00:49:55.280 --> 00:49:57.050
Kinda Gojover if ya catch my drift.

00:49:57.050 --> 00:50:02.690
Like unless this insane technique works, we
might be in for another heartbreaking death,

00:50:02.690 --> 00:50:10.640
WHICH as we all know is something Gege doesn't
hold back on.

00:50:10.640 --> 00:50:15.630
The entire calling Sukuna fraudulent is a
great meme, but dude right now seems to be

00:50:15.630 --> 00:50:20.210
implementing cursed energy in a way we’ve
never even seen it get used before, even Gojo

00:50:20.210 --> 00:50:24.079
is confused with how mans able to activate
Megumi’s abilities without hand signals

00:50:24.079 --> 00:50:25.079
or saying anything.

00:50:25.079 --> 00:50:26.079
I wonder if we’re gonna get the BOX open
during this fight and I hope I didnt release

00:50:26.079 --> 00:50:27.079
this video a week before the fight ends.

00:50:27.079 --> 00:50:28.079
As of now I feel like we’re into the second
stage of this battle.

00:50:28.079 --> 00:50:29.079
People from both sides could be showing up
to try and fight the injured sorcerers now,

00:50:29.079 --> 00:50:30.079
Sukuna still has a plethora of abilities he
can use that we’ve never even seen and not

00:50:30.079 --> 00:50:31.079
to mention Gojo’s Maximum or Unlimited Hollow
Technique.

00:50:31.079 --> 00:50:32.079
If you did enjoy this fight and want to keep
upto date with Jujutsu kaisen in general,

00:50:32.079 --> 00:50:33.369
then make sure to subscribe and also be sure
to leave a like as it truly helps out with

00:50:33.369 --> 00:50:36.030
bringing a bunch of new people to this channel.

00:50:36.030 --> 00:50:44.480
Again thanks for 170k subs, but for now its
been ya professional degenerate Diavolo and

00:50:44.480 --> 00:50:44.720
ill see you all in a bit, bye!

